# This file is a subset of the data in pre-go-benchmark.txt, the latter
# of which was produced by:
#
#   cd ncircl
#   go test -v -bench=. -benchmem ./pre/... ./ecc/elgamal
#
#   cd cryptofun
#   go test -v -bench=RSA -benchmem
# 
# Values are in ns/op.
#
# If a scheme does not support an API function, the value is 0 for that
# function.
#
# - ElGamal uses the Go standard library's P-256 curve, which provides ~128 bits of security
# - BBS98 uses the Go standard library's P-256 curve, which provides ~128 bits of security
# - RSA uses 3072-bit keys, which provides 128 bits of security.
#--------------------------------------------------------------------
